# Stage 6 checkpoint on the lantern pontoon (D-075 hold, D-087; game-design.md
# Stage 6 section 4). The solver route to frame 2109: she swims under the
# pontoon past the checkpoint (col 122) with Gelse #1 still hunting above
# her. Then she lets go of the controls and floats at the surface: the
# Gelse, waiting at the water line, stings her as Normal (death 1 at 2148). She
# respawns on the pontoon at the checkpoint (x 1954, camera x 1816), the
# scroll holds 60 frames (camera x 1816 until frame ~2268), the level is
# reset (Traundl A back at its spawn phase, the M-box fresh, no enemy on
# screen). She walks right under the M-box (col 128), bumps it and catches
# the Mozartkugel, which the bollards keep on the pontoon, before the
# edge reaches her.
level  = wolfgangsee
seed   = 1
source = handwritten
expect = dies_at frames=2148..2148 deaths=1 lives=2 event=CheckpointReached event=Respawned event=PowerUp power=big player_x>=2080
